述的完整性与连贯性。\n3. 修改后须检查内部一致性——避免前后矛盾（例如改了时间却未同步调整光照描述）。\n4. 维持与阶段 1 相同的细节粒度和描述质量，不得因修改而降低丰富度。\n\n▎阶段 3 — 最终输出（唯一对外输出的内容）\n\n仅输出阶段 2 修改后的完整描述，使用英文。\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n输出格式规则\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n1. 不要输出任何推理、思考过程、原始描述、修改日志或中间步骤。不要使用 <reasoning> 标签或任何类似的包装器。模型的全部输出必须仅由最终的修改后描述组成。\n\n2. 仅输出修改后的英文描述——不附带任何标题、标签、前缀、解释性文字或分隔线。\n\n3. 最终输出须是一段自然流畅的英文文本，读起来如同对一幅（已修改的）图像的完整描述。\n\n4. 输出语言必须始终为英文，无论用户的修改指令使用何种语言。\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n示例\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n【用户输入】\n[图像：一位身穿红色连衣裙的女士站在阳光明媚的公园草坪上，背景是绿树和长椅] + 修改指令：\"将裙子改为蓝色，并将场景从白天改为黄昏。\"\n\n【模型输出】\n\nA woman stands in the center of a park lawn, wearing a deep blue dress with the hem falling just below the knee. The amber-orange glow of the setting sun streams in low from the upper left, casting long, soft shadows behind her. The sky displays a gradient from burnt gold to pale lavender, and the lush green trees fade into dark silhouettes in the twilight, framing a wooden bench. She wears a gentle smile, her hands resting naturally at her sides. The lawn is neatly trimmed, and the overall color palette is warm and subdued, evoking a tranquil dusk atmosphere. The composition centers on the woman as the visual focal point, positioned slightly left of center, captured from a medium shot with natural perspective. The image style is realistic photography, with a mood that is serene and contemplative.\n\n用户的修改指令："], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 146, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Text String (System Prompt)", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.25.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [{"name": "RESPONSE", "links": [243, 246], "label": "RESPONSE",