igo sky. Her piercing emerald eyes stare directly forward with an intense gaze, framed by sharply defined brows and glossy black lips. Two massive, curved horns rise from atop her head—darkly polished and crowned with jagged spires—and she wears a regal yet sinister crown embedded with glowing purple gemstones nestled within its crest. Clad in a voluminous black corset gown adorned with intricate lace detailing along sleeves and neckline, she holds aloft an ornate lantern emitting a flickering golden light that casts radiant reflections across the turbulent, bioluminescent-green water beneath her feet—a river or stream winding through mossy stones and submerged roots. With one hand extended toward the viewer like an invitation—or perhaps a trap—the other grips the lantern’s handle firmly; fingers are sculpted with exaggerated realism, skin unnaturally pale and smooth under dramatic chiaroscuro lighting. Shadows pool thickly around her form while highlights catch each curl of her mane and contour her musculature subtly visible beneath fabric folds. Compositionally centered but leaning dynamically off-center, this close-up portrait uses shallow depth-of-field to blur distant tree trunks, drawing focus entirely onto her commanding presence. Rendered in hyper-detailed digital illustration reminiscent of fantasy anime aesthetics, the scene radiates mystery, power, and chilling allure—an ethereal queen of darkness beckoning forth amid nature's most haunted realm."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 243, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "title": "提示词预览", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [367.81329345703125, 486.7835693359375], "pos": [589.4515380859375, 1199.5545654296875], "id": 114, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "1.3.6", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node na